# JRebirth core

When repository uses JRebirth, reach framework's own patterns before fall back plain JavaFX

Keep responsibility every role strictly separated:

- Application boots program configures shell
- Model owns UI state bindings interaction logic
- View builds nodes delegates user actions
- Controller wires MVC events together
- Command performs one discrete action
- Service handles long-running or backend work
- Wave carries message between components
- Behavior holds small piece shared cross-cutting logic

Before create or refactor any JRebirth code read matching skill first
